<title>UK: Simon Engineering in red after disposal.</title>
<headline>Simon Engineering in red after disposal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   35.6 loss vs     2.1</p>
<p> Pretax loss		   50.6	vs profit 8.4</p>
<p> Turnover			324.7     vs    319.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The company reported a pretax loss after incurring exceptional costs of 59.3 million pounds linked to the disposal of its Access division to U.S. engineering group Terex Corp. The disposal was announced on February 24. The company is not offering any dividend to shareholders for 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name - Simon Engineering Plc</p>
</text>
